00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:20.960
rook, worked writing with it's big, that sound trick helps you recall ручка,

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:26.960
here is тетрать, тетрать, it means notebook, repeat after me, тетрать, think of

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:32.540
four pages you write on every day, that is your memory hook for тетрать, next we learn

