00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:45.360
Now we add two action words, читать means to read, читать, repeat after me, читать,

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:50.940
you cheat a little when you read fast, that is your hook, the last word is писать, писать

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:57.280
it means to write, repeat after me, писать, UP ink onto the page when you write, that

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:02.820
picture sticks, in Russian many verbs change their ending depending on who does the action.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:09.920
Take the word читать, we say я читаю when it is I read, but we say он читает when

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:16.140
it is he reads, it is like English I read versus he reads, the ending shifts every time,

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:22.100
listen again, я читаю, он читает, трат yourself, я читаю, он читает,

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.500
in Russia children start school at age 6 or 7, they often stay in the same class with

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.080
the same teacher for the first four years, this creates a closed family fearing inside

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:32.680
the classroom.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:38.040
Kids celebrate the first day of school called Дензнани, with a big bookcase for flowers

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:38.960
for their teachers.

