00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:07.740
and the English word, book, share an ancient journey, it started an ancient drink as

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:13.700
biblion, it traveled through old church Slavonic and settled in Russian long ago, along the way

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:18.880
it picked up the soft knil sound, the two words look nothing alike, yet what mean the

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.560
same thing, they share that hidden Greek root for papyrus scroll.

